<title>NEW ZEALAND: INL to announce half-yr profit on Feb 24.</title>
<headline>INL to announce half-yr profit on Feb 24.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent Newspapers Ltd said it would announce its result for the six months to December 31 on Monday, February 24, not on February 21 as previously indicated.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
